    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-10-07T07:54:22.249Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":21},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_lansare-intercapital-poland-etf-activity-7513506996814508032-F05D","text":"📢 A new ETF lands soon on the Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)!\n\nInterCapital ETF is introducing the ETF that tracks the performance of Poland’s main extended stock index. The WIG30TR index features Poland’s 30 most liquid listed companies and reflects the reinvestment of gross dividends paid.\n\n🔹 Ticker: ICWIGETF\n\nJoin us for the live launch event on October 12, starting at 10:00 AM, streamed across BVB’s official channels: Facebook, LinkedIn, and YouTube.\n\n#BVB #ETF #InterCapitalETF #Poland #BucharestStockExchange","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_lansare-intercapital-poland-etf-activity-7513506996814508032-F05D"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-10-06T06:59:26.292Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":2},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_world-investor-week-2026-%C3%AEmpreun%C4%83-cu-autoritatea-activity-7513130685591629824-Z5Bc","text":"World Investor Week 2026 împreună cu AUTORITATEA DE SUPRAVEGHERE FINANCIARĂ ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_world-investor-week-2026-%C3%AEmpreun%C4%83-cu-autoritatea-activity-7513130685591629824-Z5Bc"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-10-03T06:02:50.092Z","headline":"","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":23},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://ro.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bvb-rebranding-bursadevaloribucuresti-activity-7512029376411205632-RH_7","text":"Acum 5 ani în luna octombrie, BVB făcea un pas important spre viitor printr-o nouă înfățișare, în pas cu generațiile tinere și în acord cu viziunea noastră: aceea că investiția la Bursă devine un gest firesc pentru tot mai mulți români.\n\nDin 1995 și până astăzi, valorile noastre au rămas neschimbate: construim o comunitate de investitori tot mai educată și contribuim la dezvoltarea economiei românești. \n\nViitorul e al celor care investesc în el. 💸\n\n#BVB #Rebranding #BursadeValoriBucuresti #PiatadeCapital","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bvb-rebranding-bursadevaloribucuresti-activity-7512029376411205632-RH_7"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-10-01T07:03:11.661Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":10},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bvbresearchhub-bvbresearchhub-bvb-activity-7511319790641283072-fTNL","text":"📢 A new Re-initiation of Coverage report on TTS (Transport Trade Services) S.A. is now available on the #BVBResearchHub platform.\n\n💡Prepared by Erste Group Research and published on October 1, 2026, the report resumes coverage on the company, examining its prospects amidst a rebound in operations and profitability, improved efficiency of existing capacity, and the completion of key recent port investments. (link in comments)\n\n📄📊 The research reports published on #BVBResearchHub can help you make smarter trading decisions on the Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB). These are in-depth reports, prepared by expert analysts, offering a clear picture of the Romanian capital market.\n\n#BVB #BVBResearchHub #BVBRH #TTSTransportTradeServices #ErsteGroupResearch","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bvbresearchhub-bvbresearchhub-bvb-activity-7511319790641283072-fTNL"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-29T12:22:01.580Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":64},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bimx-bimx-capitalmarketforum-activity-7510675251609907200--3JM","text":"🎤 The Capital Market Forum, held on September 28 as part of Moldova Business Week, offered valuable insights for the stock market ecosystem in the Republic of Moldova, on the eve of the launch of Bursa Internațională a Moldovei (BIMx). The panel discussions brought together authorities, issuers, intermediaries, and partners from both the Republic of Moldova and Romania.\n\nHighlighting best practices from the Romanian capital market, the event featured insights from industry leaders:\n\n🔹 Remus Vulpescu, CEO of the Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)\n🔹 Daniela Secara, CEO of BT Capital Partners (BTCP) part of Banca Transilvania Financial Group and Board Member of the Exchange, BTCP being one of the benchmark intermediaries on the BVB\n🔹 OVIDIU LUCIAN ISAC, CEO of SSIF Estinvest SA – a brokerage company with over 30 years of history and one of the founding members of the BVB\n🔹 Daniela Maior, PhD, CEO of VERTIK Group – a company providing a wide range of specialized services for listed companies, prospects, and companies interested in growth\n🔹 Stefan Pompi Musgociu, IR Manager at Electroalfa International – one of the Romanian companies listed on the BVB this year, with an already remarkable stock market track record and a recent inclusion in the BET index\n\nThis special event was organized by Comisia Națională a Pieței Financiare (National Commission for Financial Markets), Bursa Internațională a Moldovei, EBA Moldova (European Business Association), Invest Moldova Agency in partnership with UN Women Moldova, the Embassy of Canada to Romania, Bulgaria & Moldova, UNDP Moldova, Visa and maib.\n\n🙌 We are confident that the operationalization of #BIMx will connect the financial market in the Republic of Moldova to international standards and strengthen Moldova's economic potential. We wish the BIMx team great success on this ambitious new journey!\n\n#BIMx #CapitalMarketForum #MoldovaBusinessWeek #BVB #CapitalMarket #RepublicOfMoldova #Investments #FinancialMarkets","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bimx-bimx-capitalmarketforum-activity-7510675251609907200--3JM"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-29T06:41:02.714Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":4},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_worldinvestorweek2026-wiw-worldinvestorweek2026-activity-7510589440902336512-NF4B","text":"💡 A new week dedicated to financial education begins! #WorldInvestorWeek2026\n\nWorld Investor Week 2026 campaign kicks off in Romania on October 6 with an event organized by AUTORITATEA DE SUPRAVEGHERE FINANCIARĂ and Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB). 11th-grade students from Iulia Hasdeu National College in Bucharest will attend financial education presentations at the BVB headquarters, while students from high schools across Romania and the Republic of Moldova will join via live stream.\n\nThis year’s #WIW topics focus on investor resilience in making financial decisions at a time when digital deception attempts are on the rise, making vigilance and fraud prevention more important than ever.\n\n👀 Watch the event LIVE on October 6, starting at 10:00 AM, on BVB’s Facebook, LinkedIn, and YouTube channels!\n\n#WorldInvestorWeek2026 #WIW #ASF #IOSCO #BVB #BucharestStockExchange #FinancialEducation #FinancialLiteracy #InvestorResilience #DigitalDeception #ScamAlert","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_worldinvestorweek2026-wiw-worldinvestorweek2026-activity-7510589440902336512-NF4B"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-28T13:23:52.786Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":76},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bimx-moldovainternationalstockexchange-activity-7510328429666459648-dL7r","text":"🎉 The bell of Bursa Internațională a Moldovei (BIMx) rang today, September 28, for the first time in Chișinău.\n\nDuring Moldova Business Week 2026, BIMx representatives, its shareholders, and key stakeholders took the stage for the ceremonial ringing of the bell, marking the start of the market participant and issuers admission process and BIMx’s transition to the final stage before trading begins. \n\nAs a strategic partner, the Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB) closely supports BIMx in its preparations to admit the first financial instruments to trading. BVB gifted the customized BIMx bell as a symbolic gesture of support, accompanied by the wish that it may mark many successful listings and boost the development of the capital market in the Republic of Moldova.\n\nVeronica Arpintin, Remus Vulpescu, Alin Barbu\n#BIMx #MoldovaInternationalStockExchange #RingTheBell #MoldovaBusinessWeek #BVB","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bimx-moldovainternationalstockexchange-activity-7510328429666459648-dL7r"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-25T15:48:42.562Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":31},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://ro.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bvb-piatadecapital-zf-activity-7509277713635954688-DWUK","text":"📊 ZF Piața de Capital 2026, desfășurat pe 25 septembrie, a reunit reprezentanți de top din ecosistemul bursier al României – autorități, operator de piață, emitenți, intermediari, fonduri de pensii și de investiții, parteneri ai pieței de capital – pentru a discuta despre cum se traduce dinamismul de la Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB) în capital de creștere pentru companiile locale. \n\nÎn intervenția sa, Remus Vulpescu, CEO BVB, a adus în discuție, alături de alte subiecte, lansarea Pieței de Creștere ce va avea loc în curând și va oferi companiilor românești noi posibilități de a atrage finanțare prin piața de capital. \n\nDe asemenea, Remus a anunțat în premieră că BVB pregătește lansarea pe Piața Reglementată a unui indice compus din companii antreprenoriale. Mai multe detalii despre indice vor fi disponibile odată cu publicarea metodologiei. \n\n 👏 Felicitări, Ziarul Financiar, pentru încă un eveniment dedicat pieței de capital din România, organizat cu succes! \n\n#BVB #PiatadeCapital #ZF #BursadeValoriBucuresti #PiatadeCrestere","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bvb-piatadecapital-zf-activity-7509277713635954688-DWUK"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange"},"datePublished":"2026-09-24T07:16:26.672Z","headline":"","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":17},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://ro.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bvb-starinvest-reit-activity-7508786410099912705-Ho9X","text":"📢 De astăzi, 24 septembrie, Star Invest - REIT beneficiază de servicii de Market Maker al Emitentului din partea BRK Financial Group. Prezența Market Maker-ului sporește lichiditatea acțiunilor cu simbol REIT la Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB), le crește vizibilitatea și contribuie la o evaluare corectă pe piață. \n\nStar Invest își consolidează poziția într-un sector dinamic și cu un potențial imens în România: cel al platformelor de investiții imobiliare. \n\n„𝐼̂𝑛 𝑐𝑎𝑙𝑖𝑡𝑎𝑡𝑒 𝑑𝑒 𝑝𝑙𝑎𝑡𝑓𝑜𝑟𝑚𝑎̆ 𝑑𝑒 𝑖𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡𝑖𝑡̦𝑖𝑖 𝑙𝑖𝑠𝑡𝑎𝑡𝑎̆ 𝑙𝑎 𝐵𝑢𝑟𝑠𝑎 𝑑𝑒 𝑉𝑎𝑙𝑜𝑟𝑖 𝐵𝑢𝑐𝑢𝑟𝑒𝑠̦𝑡𝑖, 𝑐𝑎𝑟𝑒 𝑜𝑓𝑒𝑟𝑎̆ 𝑖𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡𝑖𝑡𝑜𝑟𝑖𝑙𝑜𝑟 𝑎𝑐𝑐𝑒𝑠 𝑙𝑎 𝑠𝑒𝑐𝑡𝑜𝑟𝑢𝑙 𝑖𝑚𝑜𝑏𝑖𝑙𝑖𝑎𝑟, 𝑆𝑡𝑎𝑟 𝐼𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡 𝑢𝑟𝑚𝑎̆𝑟𝑒𝑠̦𝑡𝑒 𝑎𝑡𝑎̂𝑡 𝑑𝑒𝑧𝑣𝑜𝑙𝑡𝑎𝑟𝑒𝑎 𝑢𝑛𝑢𝑖 𝑝𝑜𝑟𝑡𝑜𝑓𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑢 𝑠𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑑 𝑑𝑒 𝑖𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡𝑖𝑡̦𝑖𝑖, 𝑐𝑎̂𝑡 𝑠̦𝑖 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑠𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑑𝑎𝑟𝑒𝑎 𝑝𝑟𝑒𝑧𝑒𝑛𝑡̦𝑒𝑖 𝑠̦𝑖 𝑙𝑖𝑐ℎ𝑖𝑑𝑖𝑡𝑎̆𝑡̦𝑖𝑖 𝑠𝑎𝑙𝑒 𝑝𝑒 𝑝𝑖𝑎𝑡̦𝑎 𝑑𝑒 𝑐𝑎𝑝𝑖𝑡𝑎𝑙. 𝐼̂𝑛 𝑐𝑒𝑖 𝑐𝑖𝑛𝑐𝑖 𝑎𝑛𝑖 𝑑𝑒 𝑙𝑎 𝑙𝑖𝑠𝑡𝑎𝑟𝑒𝑎 𝑝𝑒 𝑝𝑖𝑎𝑡̦𝑎 𝐴𝑒𝑅𝑂, 𝑎𝑚 𝑚𝑒𝑛𝑡̦𝑖𝑛𝑢𝑡 𝑜 𝑝𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑡𝑖𝑐𝑎̆ 𝑑