mments).\n\n 📄 📊 The research reports published on #BVBResearchHub can help you make smarter trading decisions on the Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB). These are in-depth reports, prepared by expert analysts, offering a clear picture of the Romanian capital market.\n\n#BVB #BVBResearchHub #BVBRH #SpheraFranchiseGroup #SFG #ErsteGroupResearch","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/bucharest-stock-exchange_bvbresearchhub-bvbresearchhub-bvb-activity-7507740690341363712-g1T3"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","url":"https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"4-8 Nicolae Titulescu Avenue, 1st floor, East Wing, district 1, America House Building","addressLocality":"Bucharest","addressRegion":"Romania","postalCode":"011141 ","addressCountry":"RO"},"description":"Welcome to the official page of the Bucharest Stock Exchange (BVB)! 📈\nWe are the meeting point between visionary entrepreneurs and investors who support the Romanian economy. Whether you are an entrepreneur looking for financing or one of the over 325,000 local investors, here you will find the resources you need.\n\n✨ BVB in numbers:\nOver 350 listed companies.\nA continuously growing community of investors.\nAccess to opportunities in diverse fields of activity.\n\nThe local capital market is recognized as Emerging Market by the global index provider FTSE Russell, and as Advanced Frontier Market by MSCI.\n\nOwn the future. Invest in it. ","numberOfEmployees":{"value":111,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQG8n8GyUr9ykA/company-logo_200_200/B4DZujMzNeG8AI-/0/1767969600766/bucharest_stock_exchange_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=_1z92CDyfTcFm_yyHziH0jo-OFs6XxYz_EdBHtnZgrY","description":"Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"Own the Future. Invest in it. / Viitorul e al celor care investesc în el.","sameAs":"http://www.bvb.ro"}]}
