    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📢 A new Re-initiation of Coverage report on <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/transport-trade-services?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>TTS (Transport Trade Services) S.A.</a> is now available on the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbvbresearchhub&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BVBResearchHub</a> platform.

💡Prepared by Erste Group Research and published on October 1, 2026, the report resumes coverage on the company, examining its prospects amidst a rebound in operations and profitability, improved efficiency of existing capacity, and the completion of key recent port investments. (link in comments)

📄📊 The research reports published on <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbvbresearchhub&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BVBResearchHub</a> can help you make smarter trading decisions on the <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)</a>. These are in-depth reports, prepared by expert analysts, offering a clear picture of the Romanian capital market.

