  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">🎤 The Capital Market Forum, held on September 28 as part of Moldova Business Week, offered valuable insights for the stock market ecosystem in the Republic of Moldova, on the eve of the launch of <a class="link" href="https://md.linkedin.com/company/moldova-international-stock-exchange-bursa-internationala-a-moldovei?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bursa Internațională a Moldovei</a> (BIMx). The panel discussions brought together authorities, issuers, intermediaries, and partners from both the Republic of Moldova and Romania.

Highlighting best practices from the Romanian capital market, the event featured insights from industry leaders:

🔹 <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/in/remus-vulpescu-87249279?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Remus Vulpescu</a>, CEO of the <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)</a>
🔹 <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/in/daniela-secara-77633588?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Daniela Secara</a>, CEO of <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bt-capitalpartners?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>BT Capital Partners</a> (BTCP) part of <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/banca-transilvania?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Banca Transilvania</a> Financial Group and Board Member of the Exchange, BTCP being one of the benchmark intermediaries on the BVB
🔹 <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/in/ovidiu-lucian-isac-a15a6b51?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>OVIDIU LUCIAN ISAC</a>, CEO of <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/ssif-estinvest-sa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>SSIF Estinvest SA</a> – a brokerage company with over 30 years of history and one of the founding members of the BVB
🔹 <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/in/danielamaior?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Daniela Maior, PhD</a>, CEO of <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/vertik-group?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>VERTIK Group</a> – a company providing a wide range of specialized services for listed companies, prospects, and companies interested in growth
🔹 <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/in/stefan-pompi-musgociu-02666151?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stefan Pompi Musgociu</a>, IR Manager at <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/electroalfa-international?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Electroalfa</a> International – one of the Romanian companies listed on the BVB this year, with an already remarkable stock market track record and a recent inclusion in the BET index

This special event was organized by <a class="link" href="https://md.linkedin.com/company/comisia-na%C8%9Bional%C4%83-a-pie%C8%9Bei-financiare?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Comisia Națională a Pieței Financiare (National Commission for Financial Markets)</a>, <a class="link" href="https://md.linkedin.com/company/moldova-international-stock-exchange-bursa-internationala-a-moldovei?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bursa Internațională a Moldovei</a>, <a class="link" href="https://md.linkedin.com/company/european-business-association-moldova?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>EBA Moldova (European Business Association)</a>, <a class="link" href="https://md.linkedin.com/company/investmoldova?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Invest Moldova Agency</a> in partnership with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/un-women?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>UN Women</a> Moldova, the Embassy of Canada to Romania, Bulgaria &amp; Moldova, <a class="link" href="https://md.linkedin.com/company/undp-moldova?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>UNDP Moldova</a>, Visa and <a class="link" href="https://md.linkedin.com/company/bcmaibsa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>maib</a>.

🙌 We are confident that the operationalization of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbimx&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BIMx</a> will connect the financial market in the Republic of Moldova to international standards and strengthen Moldova's economic potential. We wish the BIMx team great success on this ambitious new journey!

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbimx&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BIMx</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcapitalmarketforum&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CapitalMarketForum</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmoldovabusinessweek&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MoldovaBusinessWeek</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbvb&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BVB</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcapitalmarket&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CapitalMarket</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frepublicofmoldova&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#RepublicOfMoldova</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finvestments&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Investments</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffinancialmarkets&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FinancialMarkets</a></p>
