    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📢 De astăzi, 24 septembrie, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/star-residence-invest-reit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Star Invest - REIT</a> beneficiază de servicii de Market Maker al Emitentului din partea <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/brkfinancialgroup?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>BRK Financial Group</a>. Prezența Market Maker-ului sporește lichiditatea acțiunilor cu simbol REIT la <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/company/bucharest-stock-exchange?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bucharest Stock Exchange / Bursa de Valori Bucuresti (BVB)</a>, le crește vizibilitatea și contribuie la o evaluare corectă pe piață. 

Star Invest își consolidează poziția într-un sector dinamic și cu un potențial imens în România: cel al platformelor de investiții imobiliare. 

„𝐼̂𝑛 𝑐𝑎𝑙𝑖𝑡𝑎𝑡𝑒 𝑑𝑒 𝑝𝑙𝑎𝑡𝑓𝑜𝑟𝑚𝑎̆ 𝑑𝑒 𝑖𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡𝑖𝑡̦𝑖𝑖 𝑙𝑖𝑠𝑡𝑎𝑡𝑎̆ 𝑙𝑎 𝐵𝑢𝑟𝑠𝑎 𝑑𝑒 𝑉𝑎𝑙𝑜𝑟𝑖 𝐵𝑢𝑐𝑢𝑟𝑒𝑠̦𝑡𝑖, 𝑐𝑎𝑟𝑒 𝑜𝑓𝑒𝑟𝑎̆ 𝑖𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡𝑖𝑡𝑜𝑟𝑖𝑙𝑜𝑟 𝑎𝑐𝑐𝑒𝑠 𝑙𝑎 𝑠𝑒𝑐𝑡𝑜𝑟𝑢𝑙 𝑖𝑚𝑜𝑏𝑖𝑙𝑖𝑎𝑟, 𝑆𝑡𝑎𝑟 𝐼𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡 𝑢𝑟𝑚𝑎̆𝑟𝑒𝑠̦𝑡𝑒 𝑎𝑡𝑎̂𝑡 𝑑𝑒𝑧𝑣𝑜𝑙𝑡𝑎𝑟𝑒𝑎 𝑢𝑛𝑢𝑖 𝑝𝑜𝑟𝑡𝑜𝑓𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑢 𝑠𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑑 𝑑𝑒 𝑖𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡𝑖𝑡̦𝑖𝑖, 𝑐𝑎̂𝑡 𝑠̦𝑖 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑠𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑑𝑎𝑟𝑒𝑎 𝑝𝑟𝑒𝑧𝑒𝑛𝑡̦𝑒𝑖 𝑠̦𝑖 𝑙𝑖𝑐ℎ𝑖𝑑𝑖𝑡𝑎̆𝑡̦𝑖𝑖 𝑠𝑎𝑙𝑒 𝑝𝑒 𝑝𝑖𝑎𝑡̦𝑎 𝑑𝑒 𝑐𝑎𝑝𝑖𝑡𝑎𝑙. 𝐼̂𝑛 𝑐𝑒𝑖 𝑐𝑖𝑛𝑐𝑖 𝑎𝑛𝑖 𝑑𝑒 𝑙𝑎 𝑙𝑖𝑠𝑡𝑎𝑟𝑒𝑎 𝑝𝑒 𝑝𝑖𝑎𝑡̦𝑎 𝐴𝑒𝑅𝑂, 𝑎𝑚 𝑚𝑒𝑛𝑡̦𝑖𝑛𝑢𝑡 𝑜 𝑝𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑡𝑖𝑐𝑎̆ 𝑑𝑒 𝑑𝑖𝑣𝑖𝑑𝑒𝑛𝑑𝑒 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑠𝑒𝑐𝑣𝑒𝑛𝑡𝑎̆, 𝑖𝑎𝑟 𝑖̂𝑛 𝑎𝑐𝑒𝑠𝑡 𝑎𝑛 𝑎𝑚 𝑖̂𝑛𝑐ℎ𝑒𝑖𝑎𝑡 𝑐𝑢 𝑠𝑢𝑐𝑐𝑒𝑠 𝑜 𝑚𝑎𝑗𝑜𝑟𝑎𝑟𝑒 𝑑𝑒 𝑐𝑎𝑝𝑖𝑡𝑎𝑙. 𝐼̂𝑛 𝑙𝑢𝑛𝑎 𝑎𝑢𝑔𝑢𝑠𝑡, 𝑛𝑒-𝑎𝑚 𝑠𝑖𝑡𝑢𝑎𝑡 𝑖̂𝑛 𝑇𝑜𝑝 20 𝑎𝑙 𝑐𝑒𝑙𝑜𝑟 𝑚𝑎𝑖 𝑡𝑟𝑎𝑛𝑧𝑎𝑐𝑡̦𝑖𝑜𝑛𝑎𝑡̦𝑖 𝑒𝑚𝑖𝑡𝑒𝑛𝑡̦𝑖 𝑑𝑒 𝑝𝑒 𝑝𝑖𝑎𝑡̦𝑎 𝐴𝑒𝑅𝑂, 𝑖̂𝑛 𝑡𝑖𝑚𝑝 𝑐𝑒 𝑖̂𝑛 𝑢𝑙𝑡𝑖𝑚𝑒𝑙𝑒 12 𝑙𝑢𝑛𝑖, 𝑝𝑒𝑠𝑡𝑒 16 𝑚𝑖𝑙𝑖𝑜𝑎𝑛𝑒 𝑑𝑒 𝑎𝑐𝑡̦𝑖𝑢𝑛𝑖 𝑎𝑢 𝑓𝑜𝑠𝑡 𝑡𝑟𝑎𝑛𝑠𝑓𝑒𝑟𝑎𝑡𝑒 𝑖̂𝑛 𝑎𝑝𝑟𝑜𝑎𝑝𝑒 3.000 𝑑𝑒 𝑡𝑟𝑎𝑛𝑧𝑎𝑐𝑡̦𝑖𝑖, 𝑒𝑣𝑜𝑙𝑢𝑡̦𝑖𝑒 𝑐𝑎𝑟𝑒 𝑟𝑒𝑓𝑙𝑒𝑐𝑡𝑎̆ 𝑖𝑛𝑡𝑒𝑟𝑒𝑠𝑢𝑙 𝑖𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡𝑖𝑡𝑜𝑟𝑖𝑙𝑜𝑟 𝑝𝑒𝑛𝑡𝑟𝑢 𝑐𝑜𝑚𝑝𝑎𝑛𝑖𝑒, 𝑚𝑜𝑑𝑒𝑙𝑢𝑙 𝑛𝑜𝑠𝑡𝑟𝑢 𝑑𝑒 𝑏𝑢𝑠𝑖𝑛𝑒𝑠𝑠 𝑠̦𝑖 𝑑𝑖𝑟𝑒𝑐𝑡̦𝑖𝑖𝑙𝑒 𝑠𝑎𝑙𝑒 𝑑𝑒 𝑑𝑒𝑧𝑣𝑜𝑙𝑡𝑎𝑟𝑒. 𝐶𝑜𝑙𝑎𝑏𝑜𝑟𝑎𝑟𝑒𝑎 𝑐𝑢 𝐵𝑅𝐾 𝐹𝑖𝑛𝑎𝑛𝑐𝑖𝑎𝑙 𝐺𝑟𝑜𝑢𝑝, 𝑖̂𝑛 𝑐𝑎𝑙𝑖𝑡𝑎𝑡𝑒 𝑑𝑒 𝑀𝑎𝑟𝑘𝑒𝑡 𝑀𝑎𝑘𝑒𝑟, 𝑣𝑎 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑡𝑟𝑖𝑏𝑢𝑖 𝑙𝑎 𝑠𝑢𝑠𝑡̦𝑖𝑛𝑒𝑟𝑒𝑎 𝑙𝑖𝑐ℎ𝑖𝑑𝑖𝑡𝑎̆𝑡̦𝑖𝑖 𝑎𝑐𝑡̦𝑖𝑢𝑛𝑖𝑙𝑜𝑟, 𝑙𝑎 𝑜 𝑓𝑜𝑟𝑚𝑎𝑟𝑒 𝑚𝑎𝑖 𝑒𝑓𝑖𝑐𝑖𝑒𝑛𝑡𝑎̆ 𝑎 𝑝𝑟𝑒𝑡̦𝑢𝑙𝑢𝑖 𝑠̦𝑖 𝑙𝑎 𝑜 𝑚𝑎𝑖 𝑏𝑢𝑛𝑎̆ 𝑑𝑖𝑠𝑝𝑜𝑛𝑖𝑏𝑖𝑙𝑖𝑡𝑎𝑡𝑒 𝑎 𝑎𝑐𝑡̦𝑖𝑢𝑛𝑖𝑙𝑜𝑟 𝑝𝑒𝑛𝑡𝑟𝑢 𝑡𝑟𝑎𝑛𝑧𝑎𝑐𝑡̦𝑖𝑜𝑛𝑎𝑟𝑒, 𝑖̂𝑛 𝑏𝑒𝑛𝑒𝑓𝑖𝑐𝑖𝑢𝑙 𝑡𝑢𝑡𝑢𝑟𝑜𝑟 𝑎𝑐𝑡̦𝑖𝑜𝑛𝑎𝑟𝑖𝑙𝑜𝑟 𝑛𝑜𝑠̦𝑡𝑟𝑖. 𝑉𝑒𝑑𝑒𝑚 𝑎𝑐𝑒𝑠𝑡 𝑝𝑎𝑠 𝑐𝑎 𝑝𝑎𝑟𝑡𝑒 𝑎 𝑢𝑛𝑒𝑖 𝑠𝑡𝑟𝑎𝑡𝑒𝑔𝑖𝑖 𝑚𝑎𝑖 𝑎𝑚𝑝𝑙𝑒 𝑑𝑒 𝑑𝑒𝑧𝑣𝑜𝑙𝑡𝑎𝑟𝑒 𝑎 𝑆𝑡𝑎𝑟 𝐼𝑛𝑣𝑒𝑠𝑡 𝑐𝑎 𝑒𝑚𝑖𝑡𝑒𝑛𝑡 𝑙𝑖𝑠𝑡𝑎𝑡 𝑠̦𝑖 𝑑𝑒 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑠𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑑𝑎𝑟𝑒 𝑎 𝑝𝑟𝑒𝑧𝑒𝑛𝑡̦𝑒𝑖 𝑐𝑜𝑚𝑝𝑎𝑛𝑖𝑒𝑖 𝑝𝑒 𝑝𝑖𝑎𝑡̦𝑎 𝑑𝑒 𝑐𝑎𝑝𝑖𝑡𝑎𝑙”, a precizat <a class="link" href="https://ro.linkedin.com/in/davidcanta?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>David Canta</a>, CEO <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/star-residence-invest-reit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Star Invest - REIT</a>.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbvb&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BVB</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fstarinvest&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#StarInvest</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Freit&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#REIT</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbrkfinancialgroup&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BRKFinancialGroup</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmme&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MME</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

